I added the missing citations to the three flagged passages; the references are in place and `paper.pdf` compiles. I did not rerun the page-fill, figure-manifest or Supplementary Information rendering checks, because `pdftotext` is missing so `compile_latex.sh` can't run, and `validate_figures.py` can't import `src`. The citation-key check, claims validation and evidence verifier all passed.

